      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Set extension\n\nThe plate is 512x288. `ImagePadForOutpaint` adds 96px left, 96px right, 32px top and 64px bottom, so the delivered frame is 704x384 — both divisible by 16, which `WanVaceToVideo` requires.\n\nThe pad node's MASK is the new territory. It goes round through `MaskToImage` → `RepeatImageBatch` → `ImageToMask` so it can be repeated to match `length`; at length 1 that is a single frame, and VACE outpaints the still.\n\nChange the pad and you must change Width and Height to match, or `WanVaceToVideo` rescales the plate and the original pixels stop lining up.\n\n1.3B + CausVid LoRA: steps 3, cfg 1.0, shift 8.0."
      ],
      "title": "How the extension is framed"
    },
